Description: MATE color management daemon (Night Light)
 Rojo is the color management daemon of the MATE desktop. At the moment it
 provides Night Light and gamma control as a replacement for redshift, on
 both X11 (RandR) and Wayland (wlr-gamma-control).
 .
 It is a single long-running D-Bus service (org.mate.rojo) that decides the
 screen color from a sunset/sunrise or fixed-time schedule and is controlled
 over the org.mate.rojo.NightLight interface.
